#
# Patches are applied byte for byte: a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true,
# the Windows default) turns them "corrupt" for git apply and configure
# fails (#383). Git applies an LF patch to CRLF sources fine.
*.patch -text
*.diff -text

# A lab record is compared byte for byte with what records/make.sh writes,
# and the recorder writes LF everywhere; a CRLF checkout failed every lab
# gate with records on Windows (#330).
*.labrec text eol=lf
